$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Ground";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Condolis V" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Night" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> face each other for control of the desert planet of Condolis V, a planet where only few plant life are able to sustain themselves in this harsh evironment.  The battle is taking place amongst ancient pyramids. There is a prized defensive position that lies directly between the two waring factions, and has been won and lost countless times.  Capture and hold this outpost and receive two team points.  Each tribe holds a pyramid for their base in a constant struggle to claim more land.  Each pyramid houses the tribal flags.  Grab the enemy tribe's flag and bring it back to the pyramid, touching it to your own flag to capture it.  Victory will be achieved by the team that successfully captures their opponent's flag 5 times.";
